    resumo:      "The LANDmaRk project targets the integration of LIDAR and optical wireless&#10;communication technologies within the same systems or devices for the future Internet&#10;of Things (IoT), including Cybe",
    descricao:   "The LANDmaRk project targets the integration of LIDAR and optical wireless&#10;communication technologies within the same systems or devices for the future Internet&#10;of Things (IoT), including Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS), such autonomous vehicles.&#10;Apart from the cost and size reduction, the integration of the two technologies brings&#10;further benefits. Namely, the communication domain complements the LiDAR domain&#10;information to enable the formation of higher resolution scene imagery, and the&#10;LiDAR domain is instrumental for the establishment, coordination and maintenance&#10;of high capacity wireless communication links. LANDmaRk will provide the fusion of&#10;communication and optical reflectometry, with fast high resolution mapping and high&#10;speed communication links to support vehicles sharing of multi-gigabit data about the&#10;surrounding environment and recognizing objects in real time. Therefore, vehicles are&#10;able to determine the optimal driving strategy collaboratively.",
